{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "46a742d4-0a11-8173-b9e3-5c6536ee739e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:06:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I am calling about a pothole, on Spring Street. It is wicked, no, sorry, it is very deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, whereabouts on Spring Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In front of 171 Spring Street. It is my mother's house, I am calling for her. The hole, it is big enough to swallow a tire, no way I am exaggerating. [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. Did you say it could swallow a tire?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a tire. And a neighbor hit it too, over the weekend. After the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, it got much worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, we get a lot of those after a storm like that. Was there any damage to his car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think the tire, yes, but I do not know more. Can you add the street to the repair list, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll put it in. Can I get a callback number and the zip code for the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. The number is 401-555-0155. And the zip is 02940."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 02940. Let me read it back, that's the number, 401-555-0155, and zip 02940."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, no, no. Not 02940. It is 02840. Zero two eight four zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 02840. Thanks for catching that. So that's 171 Spring Street, large pothole in front of the house, added to the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, perfect. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
